nt his  choice for secretary of state anthony  blinken is expected to be confirmed  later today by the senate  also here at the white house today the  president is expected to use his  executive authorities  to fight racism against asian americans  specifically he's expected to try  to curb anti-asian bias sparked  by the pandemic tony all right ed thank  you very much
 

